<section class="home-intro">
  <div class="home-intro-text">
    <p>Hi, thank you for visiting my blog! I am a software developer. Before creating this website I didn’t know I liked to write… it brings out the creative part of me. Here you will find posts about everyday life, sports, food, travel, kids, family and pretty much anything that inspires me to write.</p>

    <p>Even though I am a software developer and I use AI to code, my only rule for this blog is that everything is created by me, what you read and see in the posts is my original creation.</p>

    <%= link_to "Enter the Blog", blog_path, class: "btn" %>
  </div>

  <%= image_tag "home-photo.jpg", alt: "A scruffy ginger dog looking up at the camera", class: "home-intro-photo", width: 853, height: 1280 %>
</section>
